```mdl
verdict Pipeline: The ECHO type matches: optional name, description and image, and a form-hidden columns array.
  status: untested
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/types/src/types/Pipeline.ts#Pipeline, github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/types/src/types/Pipeline.ts#make]
  note: Typename `org.dxos.type.pipeline` at 0.1.0; `make` defaults `columns` to `[]`. No test covers the type's fields.
```

```mdl
verdict Column: The fields exist, but order is never used to sort items.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/types/src/types/Pipeline.ts#Column, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-pipeline/src/hooks/usePipelineBoardModel.ts#usePipelineBoardModel]
  note: |
    `name`, `view: Ref<View>` and `order` are declared. The board model lists the view query's results
    reversed and never reads `order`, so the "ordered items first" invariant is not met.
```

```mdl
verdict ViewModel: A View object stores the query AST and projection; the JSON schema is an input, not a stored field.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/schema/src/types/ViewModel.ts#make]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/schema/src/types/View.test.ts]
  note: `ViewModel.make` builds a `View.View` with `query.ast` and `projection`; `jsonSchema` only seeds the projection.
```

